# I-21 remediation (plans/deposito-seguro-audit-report.md §11): third-party
# AI coding-tool session state (Kilo Code worktrees, Qodo scaffolding) — was
# previously excluded only by .kilo/'s own internal .gitignore, which
# doesn't protect against `git add -A` from the repo root.
.kilo/
.qodo/
